<title>USA: TWO BANKS NOW ELIGIBLE UNDER ROMANIA GSM-102 - USDA.</title>
<headline>TWO BANKS NOW ELIGIBLE UNDER ROMANIA GSM-102 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Friday said it amended the allocation for sales to Romania under the Export Credit Guarantee Program (GSM-102) to include as eligible banks, Banca Agricola S.A. and Banca de Export-Import a Romaniei S.A.</p>
<p>USDA said the total fiscal year 1996 allocation for sales to Romania under GSM-102 remains unchanged at $100 million.</p>
